      "summary": {
        "unit_id": "hmh07-lua:229",
        "answer": "Common Hud directly constructs armor overlay wrapper. For a HUDItems.armorOverlay notification, the callback reads model:get(); when that result is not nil, it directly calls RegisterImage(value) and then ArmorOverlayImage:setImage with the returned image. A false model value still passes this nonnil guard; provider errors and rendering remain unverified; ArmorActive delegates IsArmorOverlayActive and hudItems.armorOverlay changes reevaluate state. CallOriginalSecond close registers self.__onClose, outside frozen primary body remains an exact dependency. Optional postload then self return. This displays externally produced armor data; it does not change armor or establish native rendering.",
        "unknowns": [
          "Original Lua-to-PS4 CUSA11100 build binding and bytecode/VM/decompiler fidelity unverified.",
          "Effective HMH settings, enum values, model/data production, LUI state arbitration, event delivery/ordering/cancellation, assets, storage/DDL, networking/service behavior remain explicit gaps where called.",
          "External helper bodies not selected here are dependencies only; no nil/error recovery assumed beyond visible source. Named LUI override APIs are preserved; no original/new callback ordering is guaranteed without their source contract.",
          "No independent correctness review, retail execution or function completion credit."
        ],
